   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">LogStream (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_log_LogStream_2f1f1b.html\">LogStream</a> &amp;&amp;) noexcept; DIRECTION NOT         <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_log_LogStream_2f1f1b.html\">LogStream</a> &amp;&amp;                -- DEFINED</pre>",
